      "content": "oh okay, so you're saying there's a special kind that won't interfere. that makes me feel a lot better. if i decide to go with that 500mcg k2 dose you mentioned, do i really need to go through my doctor to get that set up, or can i just pick it up online and start tomorrow? it seems like such a simple fix since they're meant to work together, and i'd really rather just handle this myself so i don't have to deal with the hassle of another appointment.",
